{"name":"Count Chocula","hex":"#5e2d10","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"count","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To recite numbers in sequence.","To determine the number of (objects in a group)."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The act of counting or tallying a quantity.","The result of a tally that reveals the number of items in a set; a quantity counted."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/count"}],"entries":[{"title":"Monster cereals","blocks":[{"text":"The monster cereals are a seasonal line of breakfast cereals produced by General Mills in North America. Since the line was introduced in 1971, it has been associated with three enduring brands: Count Chocula, Franken Berry, and Boo Berry. The brands Frute Brute and Yummy Mummy have had more limited production and availability. The Carmella Creeper brand was introduced in 2023."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/3/33/Count-Chocula-Box-Small.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Monster_cereals"},{"title":"Count","blocks":[{"text":"Count or Countess is a historical title of nobility in certain European countries, varying in relative status, generally of middling rank in the hierarchy of nobility. Especially in earlier medieval periods the term often implied not only a certain status, but also that the count had specific responsibilities or offices. The etymologically related English term \"county\" denoted the territories associated with some countships, but not all."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/61/Johan_Erik_Lindh_-_Portrait_of_Carl_Gustaf_Mannerheim_%281797-1854%29.jpg/330px-Johan_Erik_Lindh_-_Portrait_of_Carl_Gustaf_Mannerheim_%281797-1854%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Count"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/d/df/Frankenberrycereal.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 1x","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/d/df/Frankenberrycereal.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AFrankenberrycereal.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/b/bd/Boo-Berry-Box-Small.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 1x","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/b/bd/Boo-Berry-Box-Small.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABoo-Berry-Box-Small.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/f/fd/Frute_Brute_box_design.jpg/250px-Frute_Brute_box_design.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/f/fd/Frute_Brute_box_design.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/f/fd/Frute_Brute_box_design.jpg/250px-Frute_Brute_box_design.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AFrute_Brute_box_design.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/8/86/Fruity_Yummy_Mummy_box_design.jpg/250px-Fruity_Yummy_Mummy_box_design.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/8/86/Fruity_Yummy_Mummy_box_design.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/8/86/Fruity_Yummy_Mummy_box_design.jpg/250px-Fruity_Yummy_Mummy_box_design.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/F